<!--
  GENERATED by ThemeColourGenerator (tst/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia.UnitTests/Generation) from the brushes
  Palette.axaml and Base/Accents.axaml write in their Light dictionaries. Do not edit.

  Every brush is declared in each variant dictionary, so a window or ThemeVariantScope
  with its own variant paints with that variant's. These are the same brushes once more,
  following the application's variant: ApplicationVariantBrushes answers a lookup for the
  application's own variant with them, and one that names no variant (FindResource(key)
  in an app's code), so a switch recolours the brushes a control has instead of handing
  it new ones. A lookup for any other variant passes them by.
-->
